<title>ISRAEL: Israel's March CPI +1.0 pct vs +1.2 in February.</title>
<headline>Israel's March CPI +1.0 pct vs +1.2 in February.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of</p>
<p>Statistics issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>ISRAEL CONSUMER PRICES   March 97   Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p>Month-on-month change    + 1.0	+ 1.2     + 1.0</p>
<p>Year-on-year change	+10.4	+10.4     +10.8</p>
<p>Index (base 100=1993)    146.8	145.4     133.0</p>
<p>Note: To compare previous indices based on 1987=100.0, multiply indices from January 1994 by 2.421.</p>
<p>-Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-537-0502 STR TCC</p>
</text>
